; A BTC -> ETH fill and an ETH -> BTC fill at the same second on one
; exchange (Kraken books both at one block time), as four plain
; equity:trading legs under one narration. Ranked by raw amount across
; commodities the sells are [BTC 0.5, ETH 2] and the buys [BTC 0.1, ETH 10],
; which used to link BTC with BTC and ETH with ETH. Legs of one commodity are
; never a swap: BTC links with ETH in each direction.

2016-01-20 02:34:27 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:btc-sell
    assets:exchange:kraken -0.5 BTC
    equity:trading 0.5 BTC

2016-01-20 02:34:27 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:eth-buy
    assets:exchange:kraken 10 ETH
    equity:trading -10 ETH

2016-01-20 02:34:27 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:eth-sell
    assets:exchange:kraken -2 ETH
    equity:trading 2 ETH

2016-01-20 02:34:27 * "Kraken" "trade" ; txn:btc-buy
    assets:exchange:kraken 0.1 BTC
    equity:trading -0.1 BTC
